    "updated_at": "2021-09-14T11:34:35Z",
    "body": "For this issue I'm mainly interested in whether we consider it a security issue or not. And whether Chrome's solution addresses that comprehensively or not. (And I guess there's also a question as to whether a comprehensive solution is needed or something is better than nothing at all.)",
